## Why This Is Asked

A practical UX feature tests offline resilience, local storage usage, and simple cross-tab conflict handling without server changes.

## Key Concepts

- Debounce autosave
- localStorage vs IndexedDB
- Versioning for conflict detection
- Cross-tab synchronization basics

## Code Example

```javascript
// Minimal autosave scaffold
let timer;
function onChange(content){
  clearTimeout(timer);
  timer = setTimeout(()=> {
     const note = { content, lastSaved: Date.now(), version: (NOTE_VERSION++) };
     localStorage.setItem('noteDraft', JSON.stringify(note));
  }, 300);
}
```

